                    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-16 pb-10 px-4">
                        <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 md:text-4xl ">云端数据库设计</h1>
                        <div class="prose py-10">
                            <h1>Airtable 设计</h1>
<p>我在开发一个云端的 Airtable，使用 AWS Serverless + DynamoDB。</p>
<h2>定义一个对象保存数据表结构</h2>
<p>table.object.yml</p>
<pre><code class="language-yaml"># 表名
name: project
# 字段
fields: 
  _id:  
    label: ID
  space:
    label: 工作区
    type: lookup
  user:
    label: 所有者
    type: lookup
# 索引
indexes:
  $space:
    fields: space
  $space$user:
    fields: [&#39;space&#39;, &#39;user&#39;]
  $user:
    fields: user  
</code></pre>
<h2>保存记录</h2>
<p>保存记录的 DynamoDB 表：</p>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">RecordsDynamoDbTable:
  Type: &#39;AWS::DynamoDB::Table&#39;
  DeletionPolicy: Retain
  Properties:
    AttributeDefinitions:
      - AttributeName: id
        AttributeType: S
      - AttributeName: tableId
        AttributeType: S
    KeySchema:
      - AttributeName: tableId
        KeyType: HASH
      - AttributeName: id
        KeyType: RANGE
    BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST
    TableName: ${self:provider.environment.RECORDS_TABLE}
</code></pre>
<h2>保存索引</h2>
<p>索引可以提高在 Airtable 中查询时的性能。</p>
<p>设计一个索引表来存储各种索引记录。这个表的结构如下：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>索引表</strong>：<code>IndexesDynamoDbTable</code></li>
<li><strong>主键</strong>：<code>pk</code>（表名$索引字段名）</li>
<li><strong>排序键</strong>：<code>sk</code>（记录中索引对应的字段值）</li>
<li><strong>附加属性</strong>：<code>pk1</code>（表名）、<code>sk1</code>（记录 ID）</li>
</ul>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">IndexesDynamoDbTable:
  Type: &#39;AWS::DynamoDB::Table&#39;
  DeletionPolicy: Retain
  Properties:
    AttributeDefinitions:
      - AttributeName: pk
        AttributeType: S
      - AttributeName: sk
        AttributeType: S
    KeySchema:
      - AttributeName: pk
        KeyType: HASH
      - AttributeName: sk
        KeyType: RANGE
